First, start the system with the temporary key: sudo docker compose up -d

Generate the actual APP_KEY value: sudo docker exec -it snipe-web-app php artisan key:generate --show

Copy the generated key starting with "base64:" exactly and paste it into the APP_KEY field in the docker-compose.yml file.

Restart the system: sudo docker compose down && sudo docker compose up -d

The installation is complete. You can access the interface by navigating to port 8080 in your web browser.
